[B]Changes[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Fixed visual voicemail not activating. Google Phone authenticates visual voicemail with GBA (SIM-based authentication), and the ROM was missing Google's GBA service. Tested on T-Mobile US.
[*]Nothing else changed: same Evolution X source as the previous build.
[/LIST]
[B]Updating[/B] from an earlier build keeps your data:
[CODE]adb reboot bootloader
fastboot update <zip>[/CODE]
Fresh installs: see the first post.

